          <attvalue for="34" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in hostile maritime incidents (attacks, seizures, interdictions) prompts alliance members to surge escort, patrol and mine‑countermeasure taskings to protect shipping lanes, raising the tempo of forward deployments." />
