          <attvalue for="32" value="-" />
          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in hostile maritime incidents around the Strait of Hormuz forces container vessels to reroute, increases transit times and insurance/shipping costs, and causes port and container shortages that immediately reduce the volumetric flow of manufactured exports (including Chinese tech goods) to foreign markets." />
