          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained high Western defense commitments and materiel flows to Ukraine consume political capital and negotiating bandwidth (and reduce available leverage), leading to fewer or less intensive diplomatic mediation efforts focused on the Hormuz crisis." />
