          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising escalation pressure in the Russia–Ukraine war prompts Western governments to broaden and tighten export controls on dual‑use and advanced technologies to prevent diversion to Russia, and those controls are pragmatically extended to China or implemented in ways that raise barriers for Chinese tech firms." />
