          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stricter export controls and enforcement on AI tools, models, and high-end semiconductors directly curtail supply and services to Russian military contractors, slowing or downgrading upgrades to guidance/autonomy stacks for long‑range strike systems." />
