          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A growing logistics and maintenance backlog diverts defense and allied procurement budgets toward repairs and sustainment, delaying or canceling investments in new high‑performance compute infrastructure that would expand available compute capacity." />
